a:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-brand-warmwhite pb-20 text-brand-ink","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"F1 留学生 1040-NR 报税 5 步走指南\",\"description\":\"2026 留学生报税手把手教学，包含 1040-NR 核心行号填写与 Schedule OI 税收协定申请。\",\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"个人信息与身份判定\",\"text\":\"填写姓名、SSN/ITIN。F1 留学生通常属于 Nonresident Alien。务必确认你的 Filing Status。如果你是单身且没结婚，通常勾选 Single。\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"收入申报\",\"text\":\"根据你的 W-2（工资）或 1042-S（奖学金/免税收入）填写。Line 1a 填 W-2 总工资，Line 1c 填奖学金中生活费部分。\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"标准/分项扣除\",\"text\":\"留学生不能使用 Standard Deduction（印度留学生除外）。大多数留学生只需填写 Charitable Contributions 或保留为 0。\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"税收协定豁免 (Schedule OI)\",\"text\":\"在 Schedule OI 的第 L 项，注明你是中国公民，申请 $5000 的免税额度 (Treaty Article 20(c))。\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"计算退税或补税\",\"text\":\"对比 Total Tax 和 Total Payments。退税建议填写 Direct Deposit 信息以加快退款速度。\"}]}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-shell pt-12 sm:pt-20 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"mb-6 flex space-x-2 text-sm text-brand-ink/50","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-brand-pinkdeep transition","children":"首页"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"›"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/tools","className":"hover:text-brand-pinkdeep transition","children":"报税工具"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"›"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-ink font-medium","children":"1040-NR 指南"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-ink leading-tight","children":["2026 留学生 1040-NR 报税全攻略：",["$","br",null,{"className":"hidden sm:block"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep","children":"从零开始的手把手教学"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border-2 border-red-500 bg-red-50 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(239,68,68,0.1)]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-3xl sm:text-4xl shrink-0","children":"🛑"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-red-700 leading-tight","children":"🛑 停！填错表可能导致 H1B/绿卡申请被拒！"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg font-medium text-red-900/90 leading-relaxed","children":"如果你来美国不满 5 年且持 F1/OPT 身份，你必须填写 1040-NR。千万不要因为图方便使用 TurboTax 默认的 1040 表格，那会导致报税身份错误。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-lg text-brand-ink/70 leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-brand-pink/20 pl-6 bg-white/50 py-4 rounded-r-2xl shadow-sm","children":"F1/OPT 留学生怎么填 1040-NR？本文详解 W-2、1042-S 与 1040-NR 的对应关系。重点演示 Schedule OI 如何申请 $5000 中美税收协定豁免。"}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"my-16","children":["$","$L11",null,{}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-brand max-w-none prose-headings:text-brand-ink prose-p:text-brand-ink/80 prose-strong:text-brand-pinkdeep","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mt-16 mb-6","children":"第一步：准备工作——你需要哪些税表？"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-brand-pink/10","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-brand-pinkdeep","children":"W-2 (工资收入) vs 1042-S"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"W-2 记录你的税前工资和预扣税；1042-S 记录奖学金或受税收协定免税的收入。两者都非常重要。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-brand-pink/10","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-brand-pinkdeep","children":"护照出入境记录与 SSN/ITIN"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"